[Thinking]
**Converting data formatting**

I want to focus on outputting a JSON table only. I think I might need to convert dots into decimal points, but it’s important to keep the numbers as strings when pulling them from HTML. My goal is to create an output that consists of an array of objects. That way, it will be well-structured and easy to work with later on.
[/Thinking]

